        "Application Area：",
        "Used for iron removal / iron separation of various materials such as refractory materials, chemical materials, grain‑oil processing materials, abrasives, ceramics, metallurgical raw materials, cement, powder metallurgy materials, rubber and ores. It can be matched with Raymond mill, crusher and ball mill.",
