        "",
        "",
        "Product Advantages",
        "1. Equipped with hydraulically‑operated cover opening device adopting original imported components, which enables fast and convenient upper‑cover movement for labor‑saving replacement and maintenance of internal components.\n2. Excellent wear‑resistance performance.\n3. The large rotating gear is cast and hobbed; wear‑resistant liners are fitted inside the drum.\n4. Bearings adopt well‑known international brands from Japan, Sweden, the United States and other regions. Easy‑to‑operate.\n5. Simple operation with convenient switchover between two feeding modes.",
